    "en": {
      "trackName": "Snazy - Snake Game",
      "description": "Experience the classic snake game in a modern style, completely free of annoying ads! Snazy was specially developed for Apple Watch and optimized for iPhone and iPad. Collect points, beat the high score, and enjoy intuitive controls.\n\nFeatures:\n• Customizable colors\n• Endless rounds\n• Different speed levels\n• Highscore in Game Center\n• Support for light and dark mode\n• Play in landscape mode\n\nThe basic features of Snazy are completely free. With the optional upgrade (in-app purchase), you get these benefits:\n• All colors unlockable (requires high score of 100)\n• Second chance every game\n• Rainbow Mode always available\n• Smooth Mode always available\n• ... and more!\n\nWith your purchase, you support me as an independent developer. Thank you and have fun playing!\n\nPS: If you have ideas, questions, or problems, feel free to email me at info.kkaupp@icloud.com.",
      "releaseNotes": "The app icon for Snazy can now be changed reliably again.",
